est Middle East","d":"The Arabian peninsula is an ancient land of illusion. Nothing is as it seems.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b7807e5925c8589aa41e0ab696525d3d/rokuFeed/assets/2e212f332d3859d8b3e90c52c31f4f07.jpg","ep":"S01E05"},{"s":1796069580,"e":1796072580,"t":"Bondi Vet","st":"Bondi Vet","d":"Join a dedicated team of vets on animal-healing adventures across Australia.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/0a5396f61b9c5a5b9e95d36f661f6863/images/gracenote/assets/p7830930_b_h10_bj_93c878384e7b54479787c071462da57a.jpg","ep":"S14E01"},{"s":1796072580,"e":1796075640,"t":"Bondi Vet","st":"Bondi Vet","d":"Billy has a close call with the world's biggest crocodile, Cassius, during a health check.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/0a5396f61b9c5a5b9e95d36f661f6863/images/gracenote/assets/p7830930_b_h10_bj_93c878384e7b54479787c071462da57a.jpg","ep":"S14E02"},{"s":1796075640,"e":1796078700,"t":"Bondi Vet","st":"Bondi Vet","d":"Rob treats a horrific lump growing behind dachshund Leo's eye.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/0a5396f61b9c5a5b9e95d36f661f6863/images/gracenote/assets/p7830930_b_h10_bj_93c878384e7b54479787c071462da57a.jpg","ep":"S14E03"},{"s":1796078700,"e":1796081700,"t":"Bondi Vet","st":"Bondi Vet","d":"Rob performs surgery on greyhound puppy Jemima, to fix a badly fractured leg.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/0a5396f61b9c5a5b9e95d36f661f6863/images/gracenote/assets/p7830930_b_h10_bj_93c878384e7b54479787c071462da57a.jpg","ep":"S14E04"},{"s":1796081700,"e":1796085180,"t":"Wildest: Latin America","st":"Wildest: Latin America","d":"The world's longest chain of mountains, the Andes run the length of western South America and control climate.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/a8cde276dc6a581faf3851b20e46d677/images/gracenote/assets/p9110588_b_h10_br.jpg","ep":"S01E05"},{"s":1796085180,